     2799   on help of frame Dialog-Frame
     2800   do:
     2801     run gbl/app_help.p
     2802       (input this-procedure :file-name
     2803       ,input ''
     2804       ,input ?
     2805       ) no-error.
     2806     if error-status :error then do:
     2807       message
